     "message": "<ul><li>Buttons: primary action uses <code>#9333EA</code>; secondary actions stay neutral.</li><li>Inputs: strong focus-visible states, clear labels, and predictable error messaging.</li><li>Cards/sections: use consistent radii, spacing, and elevation strategy across the page.</li></ul>"
