     "message": "<ul><li>Use subtle transitions that emphasize Primary (#9333EA) as the interaction signal.</li><li>Default to short, purposeful transitions (150–250ms) with stable easing.</li><li>Ensure hover, focus-visible, active, disabled, and loading states are explicit.</li></ul>"
